,{"id":"P093-S2-Q14","number":14,"question":"25.07.26 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 39번","searchText":" 39\n\nSCR로 구성된 단상 브리지 전파정류 회로에서, 교류전압\n\n의 실횻값을 V, 제어각을 °라 할 때, 직류 평균전압\nV는? (단, 부하는 순저항부하이며, 정류기 내부 전압\n\n강하는 고려하지 않는다.)\n\n①     cos \n②     cos \n③     sin \n④     sin ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.26 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e14-m39","number":39},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e14-m39-q.webp","width":678,"height":754},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e14-m39-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P093-S2-Q15","number":15,"question":"25.07.26 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 40번","searchText":" 40\n\n갑작스러운 전압의 변화로부터 보호하기 위한 목적으로\n\n사용되는 회로는?\n\n\n① 클리퍼        ② 필터\n\n③ 스너버        ④ 정류기","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.26 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e14-m40","number":40},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e14-m40-q.webp","width":696,"height":483},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e14-m40-e1.webp","width":678,"height":840}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P093-S2-Q16","number":16,"question":"25.07.26 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 41번","searchText":" 41\n\n다음의 계통도에서 아날로그 데이터를 디지털 신호로 변환\n\n하는 PCM방식의 펄스 코드 변조 순서로 옳게 구성된 것은?\n\n\n\n\n\n      ㉠       ㉡       ㉢\n\n ①    양자화     부호화     표본화\n\n ②    양자화     표본화     부호화\n\n ③    표본화     부호화     양자화\n\n ④    표본화     양자화     부호화","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.26 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e14-m41","number":41},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e14-m41-q.webp","width":696,"height":754},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e14-m41-e1.webp","width":678,"height":548}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P093-S2-Q17","number":17,"question":"25.07.26 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 42번","searchText":" 42\n\n정전용량이 각각 F, F인 콘덴서에\n× C, × C의 전하가 각각 충전\n\n되어 있다. 두 개의 콘덴서를 병렬로 연결할 때, 축적되는\n\n정전에너지J는?\n\n\n① 0.2          ② 0.4\n\n③ 0.6          ④ 0.8","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.26 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e14-m42","number":42},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e14-m42-q.webp","width":696,"height":646},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e14-m42-e1.webp","width":678,"height":495},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e14-m42-e2.webp","width":696,"height":830}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P093-S2-Q18","number":18,"question":"25.07.26 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 43번","searchText":" 43\n\n다음 내용의 빈칸에 알맞은 것은?\n\n 선간 거리가 1.6m인 두 개의 평행 도선에 흐르는\n\n 전류의 방향이 같고, 흐르는 전류의 크기가 60A 일\n\n  때, 두 도선간에 작용하는 힘의 크기는 (  ㉠      )\n\n  N이고, 힘은 (  ㉡   )으로 작용한다.\n\n\n\n         ㉠           ㉡\n ①        ×         반발력\n ②        ×         흡인력\n ③        ×         반발력\n ④        ×         흡인력","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.26 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e14-m43","number":43},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e14-m43-q.webp","width":678,"height":763},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e14-m43-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1054}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P093-S2-Q19","number":19,"question":"25.07.26 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 44번","searchText":" 44\n\n다음 내용의 빈칸에 알맞은 것은?\n\n 선간거리, 정격전압이 동일할 때, 단상 3선식 배전선로\n\n 의 1선당 공급전력은 단상 2선식의 ( ㉠  )이고, 중성\n\n 선에는 퓨즈를 (  ㉡      ).\n\n\n\n         ㉠           ㉡\n ①         115       삽입해야 한다\n ②         115      삽입하면 안 된다\n ③         133       삽입해야 한다\n ④         133      삽입하면 안 된다","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.26 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e14-m44","number":44},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e14-m44-q.webp","width":678,"height":723},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e14-m44-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e14-m44-e2.webp","width":696,"height":655}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P093-S2-Q20","number":20,"question":"25.07.26 한국전력거래소 (사람인) · 객관식 45번","searchText":" 45\n\n공통 중성선 다중 접지방식의 배전선로에서 Recloser(R),\n\nSectionalizer(S), Line fuse(F)의 보호협조가 가장 적합한\n\n배열은? (단, 변전소를 기준으로 순서대로 나열된다.)\n\n\n① S - F - R      ② S - R - F\n\n③ F - S - R      ④ R - S – F","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.07.26 한국전력거래소 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e14-m45","number":45},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e14-m45-q.webp","width":678,"height":397},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e14-m45-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1229}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]}]}
